From 31ce9e163bfbd4a91c9c6f9544bdc51d522dc855 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FP mod <fpmod@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:54:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/26] First-person domains: F10 toggles ceilings, off by
 default

New settings key fp_ceilings (default 0), so an older fp_ceiling = 1 line
no longer turns them on. The startup log lists fpview and fp_ceilings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
